{"strongs": "H3233", "word": "יְמָנִי", "translit": "ye.ma.ni", "root": "ימם", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adjective", "gloss": "right hand, right", "definition": "יְמָנִי adjective right hand, right — masculine of pillar הָעַמּוּד הַיְמָנִי 1Kgs 7:21 = הַיְמָנִי in || 2Chr 3:17 Qr ( Kt הימיני ); feminine of side of house (temple): כֶּתֶף הַבַּיִת הַיְמָנִתַ 1Kgs 6:8 ; 1Kgs 7:39 (|| כֶּתֶף הבית מִיָּמִין ), 2Kgs 11:11 (opposed to הַשְּׂמָאלִית ), Ezek 47:1 , compare v Ezek 47:2 ; 2Chr 4:10 ; 2Chr 23:10 (opposed to הַשְּׂמָאלִית ); elsewhere of parts of body ( P ): right ear, hand and foot אזן הַימָנִית [ ה ] + ׳ יד(ם) הַי + ׳ רגל(ם) הַי Exod 29:20 ; Lev 8:23 ; Lev 8:24 ; Lev 14:14 ; Lev 14:17 ; Lev 14:25 ; Lev 14:28 right finger ׳ אֶצְבָּעוֺ הַי Lev 14:16 ; Lev 14:27 compare also right side , masculine צִדְּךָ הַיְמָנִי Ezek 4:6 Qr ( Kt הימיני ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3574')\">BDB3574</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H3233')\">H3233</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3573')\">BDB3573</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB3575')\">BDB3575</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>יְמָנִי</bdbheb> <b>adjective</b> <highlightword>right hand, right</highlightword> — masculine of pillar <bdbheb>הָעַמּוּד הַיְמָנִי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:21\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"7\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(11,7,21)\">1Kgs 7:21</ref> = <bdbheb>הַיְמָנִי</bdbheb> in || <ref ref=\"2Chr 3:17\" b=\"14\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"17\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"17\" onclick=\"bcv(14,3,17)\">2Chr 3:17</ref> <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> (<lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> <bdbheb>הימיני</bdbheb>); feminine of side of house (temple): <bdbheb>כֶּתֶף</bdbheb> <bdbheb>הַבַּיִת הַיְמָנִתַ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"1Kgs 6:8\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"6\" vBegin=\"8\" cEnd=\"6\" vEnd=\"8\" onclick=\"bcv(11,6,8)\">1Kgs 6:8</ref>; <ref ref=\"1Kgs 7:39\" b=\"11\" cBegin=\"7\" vBegin=\"3